codecut 1
title  Job Hunter Agent · how it works
size   16:9
fps    30
by     claude
theme  bg #F3EEE6  ink #1C1917  ink2 #57534E  accent #E5372A  accent2 #F27420  font "Roobert TWHINT"
brief  A 45-second product demo for Job Hunter Agent, an open-source job-application agent: drop in everything or just talk, it finds and scores roles, the résumé and form come back done, nothing is sent until you approve. Fast, simple, a little American humour; real screen recordings with fictional demo data.
lock   theme

voice  vo   voice/narration.wav
asset  tell  scenes/tell.mp4
asset  find  scenes/find.mp4
asset  ready  scenes/ready.mp4
asset  track  scenes/track.mp4
music  bed  find "light playful upbeat background, pizzicato or ukulele, positive tech explainer, instrumental"

